---
import type { Locale } from '../i18n';
import PreviewNotice from './PreviewNotice.astro';
import SpaceScreenshot from './SpaceScreenshot.astro';
interface Props { lang: Locale }
const { lang } = Astro.props;
const en = lang === 'en';
---
<div class="spaces-guide" data-spaces-guide>
  <section aria-labelledby="spaces">
    <h2 id="spaces">{en ? 'A space for each local folder' : '一个本地文件夹，一个空间'}</h2>
    <PreviewNotice lang={lang} guideLink={false} />
    <p>{en ? 'A space is an entry point to an existing folder, not another copy of your articles. Keep everyday drafts, a series and bilingual reviews in separate folders when that helps. For a few related articles, one space with series subfolders is enough.' : '空间是已有文件夹的入口，不会再复制一份文章。日常草稿、一个系列、双语审阅可以分开放；几篇相关的文章，也可以只用一个空间，在里面按系列建子文件夹。'}</p>
    <p><a class="text-link" href="/examples/md-duck-spaces.zip" download>{en ? 'Download the three-space example' : '下载三分类空间示例'}</a></p>
    <p>{en ? 'Extract the ZIP, then add Daily Drafts, Series Guides and Bilingual Review as three separate spaces. Do not also add their outer folder. If you still use beta.7, open one example folder at a time; update to beta.10 for space switching.' : '解压后，把 Daily Drafts、Series Guides、Bilingual Review 三个子文件夹分别添加为空间，不要同时添加外层目录。仍在使用 beta.7 时，可逐个打开这些文件夹阅读；更新到 beta.10 后再使用空间切换。'}</p>
    <ol class="space-guide-step">
      <li><strong>{en ? 'Add a folder.' : '添加文件夹。'}</strong> {en ? 'Click the space name at the top right, choose “Add folder…” and select an existing local article folder. Use independent folders: a folder and its parent cannot be registered as overlapping spaces.' : '点击右上角的空间名称，选择「添加文件夹…」，选中已有的本地文章目录。空间使用彼此独立的目录，不要把同一个目录及其上级重复添加为空间。'}</li>
      <li><strong>{en ? 'Switch by subject.' : '按主题切换。'}</strong> {en ? 'Choose another space from the same menu. Each space saves its last article, reading position, font size, reading mode and sidebar preferences. “Manage spaces” also lets you open a space in its own window.' : '在同一个菜单选择另一个空间。每个空间分别保存上次文章、阅读位置、字号、阅读模式和侧栏偏好。「管理空间」也可以把某个空间放到独立窗口。'}</li>
      <li><strong>{en ? 'Keep your folder habits.' : '沿用原来的文件习惯。'}</strong> {en ? 'Write and save with your usual AI or editor. MD Duck reads the saved files and shows articles with changes to review. Within a space, keep using name sorting, series folders, annotations and archiving.' : '继续用自己的 AI 或编辑器保存文章，MD Duck 读取保存后的文件，并提示哪些文章有改动待查看。在空间内部，仍按名称排序、按系列整理，照常写批注和归档。'}</li>
    </ol>
    <SpaceScreenshot lang={lang} capture="switcher" />
    <details class="space-switch-demo">
      <summary>{en ? 'Watch an 8-second space switch' : '看一次空间切换 · 8 秒'}</summary>
      <video controls playsinline preload="none" width="1440" height="960" poster="/images/spaces/switcher.webp" aria-label={en ? 'Actual space switching in MD Duck on Mac' : 'Mac 上 MD Duck 的真实空间切换'} data-space-video><source src="/images/spaces/space-switching.mp4" type="video/mp4" /></video>
      <p>{en ? 'Silent Mac beta.10 recording: open the space menu, switch between two demo folders, open space management, then return to reading. No AI task is run.' : 'Mac beta.10 无声实录：打开空间菜单，在两个演示文件夹之间切换，打开空间管理，再回到阅读。没有运行 AI 任务。'}</p>
    </details>
    <details>
      <summary>{en ? 'Renaming, moving a folder or removing a space' : '重命名、文件夹搬动与移除空间'}</summary>
      <p>{en ? 'Renaming a space changes only its display name. If its folder moves, use “Locate folder” to reconnect it. Removing a space removes the shortcut and keeps the articles, translations, annotations and reading records. Re-adding the same folder restores its space identity and saved preferences.' : '重命名空间只改显示名称。目录搬动后，用「重新定位文件夹」关联新位置。从空间列表移除只删除快捷入口，文章、译文、批注和阅读记录都会保留；以后重新添加同一目录，可恢复原空间标识与配置。'}</p>
      <p>{en ? 'Reading preferences belong to each space; AI provider configuration is shared by the app. Spaces do not provide cloud sync. On another computer, copy or sync the complete folder yourself, add it in MD Duck, then copy that computer’s own space instructions.' : '阅读偏好按空间保存，AI 服务配置由应用共享。空间不提供云同步。在另一台电脑使用时，先自行复制或同步完整文件夹，在 MD Duck 添加它，再复制这台电脑自己的空间说明。'}</p>
    </details>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="ai-location">
    <h2 id="ai-location">{en ? 'Give any AI a precise article location' : '让任意 AI 找到正确文章'}</h2>
    <p>{en ? 'Enter the target space, open the article and click “Give to AI”. Choose “Instructions for other AI”, then copy the instructions into the AI you use. They contain this computer’s space ID, absolute folder path, current article’s relative path and a link back to MD Duck.' : '进入目标空间，打开文章，点击「交给 AI」，再打开「其他 AI 的空间说明」，复制给你使用的 AI。说明包含本机的空间标识、绝对目录、当前文章相对路径，以及返回 MD Duck 的链接。'}</p>
    <p>{en ? 'Add a focused request: “Expand the sampling checklist in this article. Keep existing block markers, update the companion translation, and leave unrelated files alone.” An AI with local file access can save the revision; a chat-only AI should return the filename and complete content for you to save.' : '再补充具体要求，例如「补全这篇文章的打样清单，保留段落标记，同步修改对应译文，其他文件不动」。有本地文件权限的 AI 可以直接保存；只能聊天的 AI 应返回文件名和完整内容，由你保存。'}</p>
    <SpaceScreenshot lang={lang} capture="handoff" />
    <p>{en ? 'Keep the existing file rules: article.md with an optional article.zh.md in the same folder, local images in assets/ with relative paths, and stable block markers. Leave .review/, .mdduck/, annotations and app settings untouched. After saving, ask the AI to report the actual paths it changed and return you to the article for review.' : '继续沿用文件规则：同目录的 article.md 与可选 article.zh.md，assets/ 中的本地图片和相对路径，已有段落标记保持稳定。不改 .review/、.mdduck/、批注或应用设置。保存后让 AI 报告实际修改的路径，再回到文章复核。'}</p>
    <details>
      <summary>{en ? 'Opening a space on Mac or Windows' : 'Mac 和 Windows 怎样定位打开'}</summary>
      <p>{en ? 'Use the actual mdduck://open link copied from your app. On Mac, pass that link to the terminal’s open command; on Windows PowerShell, use Start-Process. The space ID must belong to this computer. With an article path, the link opens that Markdown file inside the space; without one, it resumes the space’s last article.' : '使用程序复制出的实际 mdduck://open 链接。Mac 终端用 open 命令打开这个链接；Windows PowerShell 用 Start-Process。空间标识必须来自当前电脑；带文章路径时打开该空间内的 Markdown，不带路径时恢复上次文章。'}</p>
      <p>{en ? 'A copied link does not sync files or grant the AI access. If the operating system has not registered the link, use the installed app’s explicit executable path with --mdduck-space and, optionally, --mdduck-file. Keep the article path relative to its space. Use beta.10 for these entry points; beta.7 does not support them.' : '复制链接不会同步文件或授予 AI 权限。系统尚未注册链接时，可用已安装程序的明确可执行文件路径，配合 --mdduck-space 和可选的 --mdduck-file；文章路径应相对于该空间。这些定位入口需使用 beta.10，beta.7 不支持。'}</p>
    </details>
  </section>
  <section aria-labelledby="codex-tasks">
    <h2 id="codex-tasks">{en ? 'Run a local Codex task' : '在当前空间启动 Codex 任务'}</h2>
    <p>{en ? 'You need Codex CLI installed and signed in on this computer. Windows also needs Codex’s sandbox setup to be ready. The task uses your local Codex login and allowance, separately from the reader’s AI translation API key. If it is not ready, the panel explains why; reading still works.' : '电脑需要先安装并登录 Codex CLI；Windows 还需要完成 Codex 自身的沙箱设置。任务使用本机 Codex 的登录和额度，与阅读器里的 AI 翻译密钥分开。未就绪时，面板会说明原因，仍可正常阅读。'}</p>
    <ol class="space-guide-step">
      <li><strong>{en ? 'Check the target before submitting.' : '先确认目标，再提交。'}</strong> {en ? 'Open “Give to AI”, check the displayed working folder and include the current article if needed. Enter a concrete request and submit it. MD Duck starts an independent task, without taking over an existing Codex conversation.' : '打开「交给 AI」，核对显示的工作目录，需要时带上当前文章。输入具体要求并主动提交后才开始。MD Duck 启动独立任务，不会接管已有的 Codex 对话。'}</li>
      <li><strong>{en ? 'Read while it works.' : '处理期间，继续阅读。'}</strong> {en ? 'The panel shows real task status, approval requests and questions. You can read and annotate, or switch to another space; the task stays bound to its original folder. In-app moves, archiving and translation are temporarily blocked during execution to avoid conflicting writes.' : '面板显示真实任务状态、审批请求与提问。你可以阅读、写批注或切到其他空间；任务仍绑定原目录。执行期间，应用内的移动、归档和翻译会暂时阻止，避免同时改写。'}</li>
      <li><strong>{en ? 'Review what was saved.' : '完成后，检查保存结果。'}</strong> {en ? '“Ready for your review” is your cue to check “Files updated during this task”. Changes saved by another editor during the same period may also appear. Read the changes and companion translation before explicitly marking them as viewed.' : '看到「已完成，待你审阅」后，从「任务期间更新」返回文章。其他编辑器在同一期间保存的修改也可能计入。检查改动与对应译文，再明确「标为已查看」。'}</li>
    </ol>
    <SpaceScreenshot lang={lang} capture="codex" />
    <details>
      <summary>{en ? 'Stopping, taking over and publishing' : '停止、接管与发布的区别'}</summary>
      <p>{en ? '“Take over” and “Stop task” interrupt the task started by MD Duck and wait for Codex to confirm. Already saved changes are not undone. Closing the app interrupts its tasks; restarting does not resume them automatically. A lost connection is shown as an unknown state, not as proof that the task stopped.' : '「我来接管」与「停止任务」会中断 MD Duck 启动的任务，并等待 Codex 确认。已经保存的修改不会自动撤销。退出程序会中断任务，重启不自动续跑；意外断连会显示状态未知，不会直接认定任务已停止。'}</p>
      <p>{en ? 'These controls do not stop another AI or editor from writing files. Ordinary file updates do not prove that an AI task is running. A completed task does not approve the article or publish it: use your own publishing tools after reviewing the final files and explicitly confirming publication.' : '这些控制不会阻止其他 AI 或编辑器写文件。普通文件更新也不代表有 AI 任务正在运行。任务完成不等于文章通过审阅或已经发布：先检查定稿，再明确确认，用你自己的发布工具上线。'}</p>
    </details>
  </section>
</div>
